Arbitrary-quarter anonymous COW qualification
=============================================

Run on the audited native16K kernel through an established4K ABI launcher,
with CAP_SYS_ADMIN for visible pagemap PFNs:
  userpages 4k ./same-quarter --native-16k > same-quarter.log
  python3 check-any-quarter.py same-quarter.log
  userpages 4k ./file-cow-consumers --native-16k
  userpages 4k ./same-native --native-16k

same-quarter: two fresh owner+child arms compare4MiB changed data in same versus
balanced virtual quarters of a16MiB dense parent. Exact nativePFN union, no
modified-child alias to parent/unchangedchild, all-byte isolation and histograms.
The binary reports measurements; the checker requires both arms <=6MiB native
for4MiB changed and actual nonzero physical-quarter use in the same-quarter arm.
This catches the old16MiB same-quarter result while allowing bounded pool slack.
30s supervisor/20s child alarms, group/subreaper cleanup, no pressure.

file-cow-consumers:1MiB owned memfd,two private views; child explicitly READ-
prefaults both views AFTER fork (fork may omit reconstructible file PTEs).
CPU COW, remote typed GUP read-unshare/write-COW each require actual physical/
logical quarter mismatch and correct file-to-anonymous transition. Then shifted
VA mremap must preserve every actualPFN and byte; post-move GUP and parent/file
isolation are checked.30s supervisor/20s child. Exact stage/byte/PTE diagnostics.
This is typed GUP coverage, not long-term DMA pin or migration qualification.

same-native:16fresh three-generation trials/16KiB logical payload. B's first COW
is retained by held C while B COWs again. Required distinct4KPFNs sharing native
PFN/4 prove source/destination use one nativefolio; every generation and neighbor
byte stays correct. At least1actual pair is required for PASS; exit77 means
UNEXERCISED, never a coverage pass.20/5/4s supervisor/owner/held-child alarms.

No fixture changes memory policy, system swap, kernel or GPU state. Native16K
assumption is explicit; do not run density math on an unaudited kernel. Metadata
--selftest modes (where provided) are not kernel-path qualification. UFFD_MOVE
and targeted migration are separate gates; disabled UFFD/single-node systems do
not acquire those qualifications merely by passing these tests.
